WEBVTT

00:00:02.700 --> 00:00:05.650
Everyone, when you're watching Deltora Quest,

00:00:05.650 --> 00:00:09.500
make sure you're in a well-lit
room and sit far away from the TV!

00:00:17.910 --> 00:00:24.120
You are my sun now

00:00:25.210 --> 00:00:28.540
We all go through bad times

00:00:28.540 --> 00:00:31.550
no matter who you are

00:00:32.010 --> 00:00:36.970
So don't go hanging your head and feeling down

00:00:39.010 --> 00:00:45.690
Keep your head up until your heart's sky

00:00:45.690 --> 00:00:51.070
is clear again

00:00:51.940 --> 00:00:56.450
No matter where you are in this world

00:00:56.450 --> 00:00:59.950
if you're crying and trembling all alone

00:00:59.950 --> 00:01:05.290
I'll search for you, I promise

00:01:05.500 --> 00:01:08.920
Love will show me the way

00:01:10.290 --> 00:01:16.800
The sun dreams countless times

00:01:17.430 --> 00:01:23.600
Forever and always from the horizon

00:01:24.230 --> 00:01:30.980
Its shining light gives energy

00:01:32.020 --> 00:01:38.320
After all, you are my sun now

00:01:57.000 --> 00:01:59.540
<i>The first gem was the topaz.</i>

00:02:00.400 --> 00:02:03.700
<i>Then at the Lake of Tears,
the ruby was retrieved.</i>

00:02:04.400 --> 00:02:07.000
<i>Followed by the opal in the City of the Rats.</i>

00:02:07.540 --> 00:02:10.300
<i>The lapis lazuli in the Shifting Sands.</i>

00:02:10.830 --> 00:02:13.470
<i>The emerald in Dread Mountain.</i>

00:02:13.900 --> 00:02:16.350
<i>The amethyst in the Maze of the Beast.</i>

00:02:17.350 --> 00:02:24.100
<i>And then, in the Valley of the Lost, the last
gem, the diamond, was finally retrieved.</i>

00:02:56.200 --> 00:02:58.800
It's such a beautiful thing,
now that I get to look at it

00:02:59.300 --> 00:03:00.000
Yeah.

00:03:00.400 --> 00:03:04.650
And each gem has a different shine to it,
as if they're complementing each other.

00:03:05.500 --> 00:03:10.900
They must be looking forward
to being worn by the royal heir.

00:03:10.900 --> 00:03:14.500
We must find him. It will be
our last big mission.

00:03:14.500 --> 00:03:15.500
Yeah.

00:03:16.300 --> 00:03:21.200
Though, I wonder what would happen if the king's heir were to wear this.

00:03:21.600 --> 00:03:27.210
I'm sure there is a hint to finding him hidden somewhere in this book.

00:03:27.950 --> 00:03:29.300
A hint?

00:03:29.300 --> 00:03:33.900
Throughout our journey so far, this book
has given us a great number of hints.

00:03:34.300 --> 00:03:35.500
That's why I'm sure...

00:03:36.000 --> 00:03:37.600
You may be right.

00:03:38.150 --> 00:03:40.220
My father said to me:

00:03:40.700 --> 00:03:44.200
<i>When the seven gems are assembled in the Belt,</i>

00:03:44.200 --> 00:03:47.690
<i>the identity of his heir will be revealed.</i>

00:03:48.400 --> 00:03:51.300
I'm sure that we will find the heir.

00:03:51.300 --> 00:03:52.500
Yes, we will.

00:03:53.500 --> 00:03:55.320
I wonder where he is now.

00:04:06.650 --> 00:04:08.540
The sky sure is far away.

00:04:16.900 --> 00:04:17.760
Ak-Baba!

00:04:22.100 --> 00:04:24.100
It's heading for the Valley of the Lost...?

00:04:30.300 --> 00:04:31.600
The fog is...!

00:04:31.600 --> 00:04:33.100
What's happening?

00:04:33.100 --> 00:04:36.280
Could it be that this is the
Shadow Lord's doing again?

00:04:36.900 --> 00:04:39.800
Everyone, there is no need to worry.

00:04:42.000 --> 00:04:47.400
We Torans summoned this
fog back using our magic.

00:04:48.200 --> 00:04:55.200
With the fog here, the Shadow Lord won't realise
that we have freed ourselves of his grasp.

00:04:55.200 --> 00:04:56.200
I see.

00:04:56.200 --> 00:05:00.300
It's unfortunate that we must part with the sunlight and the blue sky once more,

00:05:00.300 --> 00:05:03.140
but we think now is the time for patience.

00:05:05.500 --> 00:05:08.150
This fog has a nice smell to it.

00:05:08.500 --> 00:05:11.900
This is a gentle fog, kind to
both people and animals,

00:05:12.400 --> 00:05:16.780
but there <i>is</i> another reason for this pleasant smell.

00:05:29.800 --> 00:05:31.400
Wow, that looks delicious!

00:05:31.400 --> 00:05:36.200
Enveloped by this pleasant aroma,
the Toran tribe has been revived.

00:05:36.200 --> 00:05:38.400
This is to celebrate that.

00:05:38.400 --> 00:05:41.500
Come, you can also enjoy the feast.

00:05:41.500 --> 00:05:44.700
This is all traditional Toran cuisine.

00:05:50.100 --> 00:05:51.300
It's really good!

00:05:52.000 --> 00:05:54.550
Let's grab some food for ourselves as well.

00:05:54.550 --> 00:05:55.150
Yeah!

00:05:58.000 --> 00:06:01.600
So delicious! Was this also made with magic?

00:06:01.600 --> 00:06:04.700
Magic can create many wonderful things.

00:06:05.050 --> 00:06:09.000
But, there are also things it cannot create.

00:06:09.000 --> 00:06:12.380
That is a belief we Torans share.

00:06:12.900 --> 00:06:15.400
This food is indeed a testament to that.

00:06:28.200 --> 00:06:29.500
It's an Ak-Baba!

00:06:30.300 --> 00:06:35.900
It's fine. The magical fog is sure to protect us.

00:06:42.900 --> 00:06:44.330
Is it really fine?

00:06:45.200 --> 00:06:51.300
Rest assured. Our magic has made it impossible to see through the fog from above.

00:07:08.800 --> 00:07:13.500
Never again will we succumb to the Shadow Lord.

00:07:20.900 --> 00:07:22.300
It worked!

00:07:22.300 --> 00:07:24.500
Your magic really is impressive.

00:07:24.500 --> 00:07:27.800
So you have all recovered your
magical strength, then?

00:07:28.200 --> 00:07:31.290
There are many things that
we can now do once more.

00:07:31.700 --> 00:07:37.000
Ah yes; for example, assisting
you in your journey.

00:07:40.400 --> 00:07:46.600
Please be at ease. Fardeep will
never tell of your secrets.

00:07:47.200 --> 00:07:50.220
We witnessed it with our own eyes.

00:07:51.000 --> 00:07:58.400
How you managed to win the brilliant diamond, just as the valley was set free.

00:07:59.500 --> 00:08:02.800
Thanks to you, we were saved.

00:08:02.800 --> 00:08:07.120
But yet again, you have a great burden to bear.

00:08:08.000 --> 00:08:12.120
Is there not anything we can do to help you?

00:08:12.800 --> 00:08:17.630
<i>I'm sure that the power of the
Torans could help us, but...</i>

00:08:22.000 --> 00:08:25.630
We are grateful for the offer, but sorry.

00:08:26.100 --> 00:08:31.200
It's fine. I'm sure you have your reasons.

00:08:31.600 --> 00:08:34.640
But, at the very least, please remember this.

00:08:35.200 --> 00:08:41.100
Torans have nothing to hide. We trust each other in gathering information,

00:08:41.100 --> 00:08:45.570
and we always come to the aid of
one another, no matter what.

00:08:46.200 --> 00:08:48.500
Sapier, if you would.

00:08:49.050 --> 00:08:50.000
Right.

00:08:52.050 --> 00:08:54.790
A gift to you, from the Toran tribe.

00:08:55.200 --> 00:08:57.700
It is a sign of friendship.

00:08:59.500 --> 00:09:00.500
So pretty...

00:09:00.900 --> 00:09:02.000
Indeed.

00:09:02.300 --> 00:09:09.800
We have infused that brooch with magic that will
protect you. We dearly hope it will be of good use.

00:09:09.800 --> 00:09:11.400
Thank you very much.

00:09:16.900 --> 00:09:19.600
But it really is a shame, though.

00:09:19.600 --> 00:09:24.100
The Torans had finally reclaimed their sky...

00:09:27.700 --> 00:09:31.300
It's a whole lot better than being
found out by the Shadow Lord.

00:09:31.300 --> 00:09:32.200
Yeah.

00:09:34.450 --> 00:09:35.500
Shall we go?

00:09:36.600 --> 00:09:41.380
Our mission now is to find the
king's heir as soon as possible.

00:09:42.200 --> 00:09:43.300
You're right.

00:09:43.300 --> 00:09:44.300
Yeah.

00:09:45.000 --> 00:09:50.000
Hey, before we leave, is it okay if we
say goodbye to everyone first?

00:09:50.000 --> 00:09:50.890
Yep.

00:09:59.300 --> 00:10:01.600
Excuse me, is there something wrong?

00:10:02.100 --> 00:10:07.900
Actually, there are two strangers
who have entered this valley.

00:10:09.200 --> 00:10:13.900
We cannot allow anyone to
find out about this valley.

00:10:13.900 --> 00:10:15.400
Let's find them.

00:10:15.400 --> 00:10:16.250
Yeah.

00:10:17.200 --> 00:10:19.500
I will accompany you as well.

00:10:20.300 --> 00:10:21.200
Very well.

00:10:30.650 --> 00:10:31.700
Dain?

00:10:31.700 --> 00:10:33.050
Doom?

00:10:33.050 --> 00:10:34.700
People you know?

00:10:34.700 --> 00:10:37.810
Yes. At the very least,
they're not our enemies.

00:10:39.000 --> 00:10:43.800
I must say, that boy looks exactly like a Toran.

00:10:43.800 --> 00:10:46.300
Dain's mother is Toran.

00:10:46.600 --> 00:10:51.100
His parents were captured by the Grey Guards.

00:10:51.100 --> 00:10:52.600
How awful...!

00:10:56.600 --> 00:10:58.500
You two over there.

00:11:00.000 --> 00:11:02.600
Where are you headed to?

00:11:03.800 --> 00:11:04.800
You are...!

00:11:10.800 --> 00:11:12.300
Stop it, Doom!

00:11:15.100 --> 00:11:16.000
Lief!

00:11:32.400 --> 00:11:34.100
Put down your sword, Doom!

00:11:34.100 --> 00:11:36.450
If you don't, I'll be your opponent!

00:11:38.000 --> 00:11:40.600
You're as sturdy as ever.

00:11:40.600 --> 00:11:43.100
I'll say it again! Lay down your sword!

00:11:43.100 --> 00:11:45.800
Are you saying that you know that man?!

00:11:45.800 --> 00:11:47.500
It's not what you think, Doom!

00:11:47.500 --> 00:11:51.800
This man is Fardeep, not King Endon.

00:11:51.800 --> 00:11:54.800
You were tricked by the Shadow Lord!

00:11:54.800 --> 00:11:56.000
What did you say?!

00:11:56.000 --> 00:12:01.900
The Shadow Lord tried to spread lies
among you to smear King Endon!

00:12:02.500 --> 00:12:08.300
And before anyone realised, he fooled the people into
completely forgetting about such a pathetic king!

00:12:08.300 --> 00:12:12.400
Because that way, he can maintain
control over Deltora forever!

00:12:13.300 --> 00:12:17.400
I don't believe it. Are you not
the ones being fooled, here?!

00:12:18.600 --> 00:12:20.300
Stop this already!

00:12:20.300 --> 00:12:26.900
This man trusted you after hearing
that Dain's mother was a Toran!

00:12:27.900 --> 00:12:30.700
And yet, here you are pointing a blade at him...!

00:12:30.700 --> 00:12:31.550
Doom...

00:12:36.500 --> 00:12:39.000
But why are you three here?

00:12:39.600 --> 00:12:42.800
I expect a full explanation of
what's going on here.

00:12:43.100 --> 00:12:45.200
You are the one who owes us an explanation!

00:12:45.200 --> 00:12:48.300
Why didn't you tell us about this valley?!

00:12:48.900 --> 00:12:52.800
I already told you not to
come here, no matter what.

00:12:52.800 --> 00:12:57.500
Besides, even if I had told you,
would it have stopped you?

00:12:58.650 --> 00:13:02.160
I made a promise to myself
when I left this valley.

00:13:02.700 --> 00:13:08.800
I swore never tell anyone about how King Endon had
changed sides in support of the Shadow Lord.

00:13:09.600 --> 00:13:13.000
I just told everyone that
the foolish king had died.

00:13:13.000 --> 00:13:15.700
I thought it would be better that way.

00:13:15.700 --> 00:13:20.000
But, that too was part of the Shadow Lord's tricks.

00:13:20.600 --> 00:13:24.680
Such a pitiable man, that King Endon.

00:13:26.600 --> 00:13:27.800
Let's go, Dain.

00:13:28.150 --> 00:13:30.500
It would appear that we are not needed here.

00:13:30.900 --> 00:13:32.000
Doom!

00:13:32.400 --> 00:13:34.600
I'm sorry. See you again.

00:13:36.800 --> 00:13:39.600
The one who deserves pity here is Dain.

00:13:39.600 --> 00:13:41.800
Being dragged around by Doom like that...

00:13:41.800 --> 00:13:45.700
But, why did they come here?

00:13:46.100 --> 00:13:50.430
I haven't a clue what goes on in his head.

00:13:57.800 --> 00:13:59.400
It sure is quiet.

00:13:59.400 --> 00:14:03.140
Although, it would be nice if
things could stay this way.

00:14:05.800 --> 00:14:07.400
What's wrong, Lief?

00:14:08.000 --> 00:14:09.900
You can't sleep either?

00:14:11.000 --> 00:14:15.480
Maybe we really shouldn't be
lying around here like this.

00:14:17.300 --> 00:14:23.800
Like the Ak-Baba this morning, the Shadow Lord
must still be looking for us right at this very moment.

00:14:23.800 --> 00:14:25.700
Maybe you're right.

00:14:26.100 --> 00:14:30.900
It's a shame that we can't
say goodbye, but let's go now.

00:14:30.900 --> 00:14:31.800
Yeah.

00:14:43.500 --> 00:14:47.100
Hey Lief, are you sure this
is really the right path?

00:14:47.500 --> 00:14:52.400
Doom and Dain came from this direction.
I'm pretty sure this is the right way...

00:14:52.950 --> 00:14:56.190
But, there's something unsettling about it.

00:14:58.100 --> 00:15:00.600
Filli is really nervous as well.

00:15:02.300 --> 00:15:03.600
What's wrong?

00:15:03.600 --> 00:15:04.280
Look!

00:15:10.000 --> 00:15:11.400
That's Steven's wagon!

00:15:11.400 --> 00:15:12.500
You're right.

00:15:17.100 --> 00:15:20.000
It's okay. If we walk quietly,
they won't notice us.

00:15:31.000 --> 00:15:31.730
Oh no...!

00:15:38.700 --> 00:15:40.500
Hurry up! We may have been discovered!

00:15:40.500 --> 00:15:41.490
Right.

00:15:40.500 --> 00:15:41.490
Okay.

00:15:50.000 --> 00:15:51.800
What is this creature?!

00:16:00.050 --> 00:16:02.300
Sorry. This is my fault.

00:16:02.300 --> 00:16:04.180
This isn't the time for that!

00:16:18.700 --> 00:16:21.400
Lief, let's retreat for now.

00:16:21.400 --> 00:16:22.400
Got it!

00:16:25.700 --> 00:16:27.400
Stop it, Nevets!

00:16:40.600 --> 00:16:42.300
Calm down, Nevets!

00:16:59.100 --> 00:17:00.700
Are you okay, Doom?

00:17:01.400 --> 00:17:02.900
It's nothing.

00:17:02.900 --> 00:17:06.500
How foolish of you to awaken Nevets like that.

00:17:06.900 --> 00:17:08.700
What happened?

00:17:08.700 --> 00:17:09.950
Nevets?

00:17:10.500 --> 00:17:13.100
He's Steven's brother, but...

00:17:13.100 --> 00:17:16.300
when he starts going berserk,
he can't stop himself.

00:17:16.300 --> 00:17:20.400
Why are you guys here?

00:17:20.400 --> 00:17:22.500
That's because...

00:17:22.500 --> 00:17:25.920
Before that, shouldn't you be
showing some gratitude?

00:17:26.700 --> 00:17:27.840
You're right, but...

00:17:28.300 --> 00:17:31.600
Doom was worried about you.

00:17:31.600 --> 00:17:37.000
He saw an Ak-Baba flying towards the
valley this morning and rushed here.

00:17:38.000 --> 00:17:38.810
What...?

00:17:40.000 --> 00:17:44.900
It is you three, after all. I knew you
wouldn't listen to my warnings.

00:17:44.900 --> 00:17:48.300
Seriously? You could have just
said that in the first place...

00:17:48.800 --> 00:17:51.280
What a difficult man, as always.

00:17:51.700 --> 00:17:54.000
And I could say the same
of you three, could I not?

00:17:54.600 --> 00:17:56.500
At any rate, you saved us.

00:17:56.500 --> 00:17:57.700
You have our thanks.

00:18:11.000 --> 00:18:12.220
That's...!

00:18:12.500 --> 00:18:13.500
Lief...!

00:18:15.700 --> 00:18:17.200
What are you trying to do?!

00:18:17.200 --> 00:18:18.480
Stay still.

00:18:19.250 --> 00:18:22.500
The diamond should be able to heal your pain.

00:18:30.000 --> 00:18:33.100
Was <i>this</i> the objective of your journey?

00:18:35.000 --> 00:18:38.600
Gathering all of the seven gems of this belt;

00:18:38.600 --> 00:18:42.000
that has been the objective of our journey.

00:18:42.800 --> 00:18:46.920
The Belt will surely restore peace in Deltora.

00:18:49.250 --> 00:18:55.640
But now, we have a new objective
and don't know where to go.

00:18:56.200 --> 00:18:58.000
Lief... are you sure?

00:18:58.450 --> 00:19:05.270
It's fine. Sharing this information
doesn't hurt Doom, at least.

00:19:05.800 --> 00:19:11.500
As the Torans said, this might be
the time to work together.

00:19:12.800 --> 00:19:13.990
I suppose you're right.

00:19:14.450 --> 00:19:18.100
Let's go back to where the Torans are.

00:19:18.600 --> 00:19:20.300
Together with you guys.

00:19:31.900 --> 00:19:33.720
How's the pain?

00:19:35.100 --> 00:19:37.400
Looks like the Belt worked.

00:19:37.900 --> 00:19:41.350
It's time you told us more about the Belt.

00:19:41.350 --> 00:19:42.300
Okay.

00:19:45.600 --> 00:19:47.900
This is the belt that will save Deltora.

00:19:49.300 --> 00:19:52.300
Such beautiful shine.

00:19:53.400 --> 00:19:59.700
It is said that the Belt will only reveal its true
power when it's worn by the king's heir.

00:19:59.700 --> 00:20:03.900
It could be the power we need
to defeat the Shadow Lord.

00:20:04.600 --> 00:20:08.800
"The seven gems, each with their own power.

00:20:08.800 --> 00:20:15.430
When they truly come together as one, they will unleash an even greater power."

00:20:16.200 --> 00:20:18.500
That's a passage from 'The Belt of Deltora'!

00:20:19.400 --> 00:20:28.800
I can't say this for sure, but the phrase 'truly come
together as one' seems to be the relevant point here.

00:20:30.600 --> 00:20:39.710
How do I say this... Maybe it's when all
seven tribes of Deltora work together.

00:20:39.900 --> 00:20:41.100
That's it!

00:20:41.600 --> 00:20:43.300
I see.

00:20:43.300 --> 00:20:45.500
That's pretty smart, coming from you.

00:20:45.500 --> 00:20:48.900
So you also memorised 'The Belt of Deltora', then.

00:20:48.900 --> 00:20:52.400
That's because my mother
used to read it to me a lot.

00:20:52.400 --> 00:20:54.400
Dain, do you remember?

00:20:55.550 --> 00:20:58.100
It continues like this in 'The Belt of Deltora':

00:20:58.750 --> 00:21:04.930
"When the Belt of Deltora is worn in the same form
as Adin made it, by his direct descendant,

00:21:05.500 --> 00:21:09.000
it will possess power capable
of defeating any enemy."

00:21:10.100 --> 00:21:18.300
I remember. That is why all of the seven tribes
must unite as one and find the heir.

00:21:18.300 --> 00:21:21.000
Yeah. Let's begin now!

00:21:23.100 --> 00:21:25.300
This time, with all of us together!

00:21:26.500 --> 00:21:32.090
I still can't trust the king, but at
least I can trust you, just a little.

00:21:32.500 --> 00:21:36.000
Honestly, you really can't say
anything pleasant, can you?

00:21:36.600 --> 00:21:38.840
You as well; don't make me repeat myself.

00:21:48.400 --> 00:21:51.400
Dain, could it be that you are...

00:21:51.400 --> 00:21:52.300
What?

00:21:52.900 --> 00:21:55.000
No, never mind.

00:21:55.000 --> 00:21:56.360
It's nothing.

00:22:08.900 --> 00:22:12.000
<i>First, we have to unite all of the seven tribes.</i>

00:22:12.250 --> 00:22:14.200
<i>Everything else comes after that.</i>

00:22:47.670 --> 00:22:53.390
I would be lying to you

00:22:53.550 --> 00:22:59.180
if I said I wasn't lonely

00:22:59.940 --> 00:23:05.730
I know I'm not being honest

00:23:06.320 --> 00:23:11.570
but I just can't put it into words

00:23:12.360 --> 00:23:18.540
It's for the sake of our dreams

00:23:20.160 --> 00:23:22.080
At this point

00:23:22.170 --> 00:23:27.750
to sing "I love you" to a faraway you

00:23:28.130 --> 00:23:34.090
my voice would simply fade into the wind

00:23:34.300 --> 00:23:40.390
In a way, that's worse than saying "goodbye"

00:23:40.520 --> 00:23:47.480
But someday our dreams will bloom

00:23:47.820 --> 00:23:55.820
Dreams X Dreams

00:24:06.900 --> 00:24:08.300
<i>Fardeep.</i>

00:24:09.000 --> 00:24:14.400
<i>The Shadow Lord took advantage of the evil in his heart
and turned him into the Guardian of the Valley of the Lost.</i>

00:24:14.400 --> 00:24:17.900
<i>He originally lived in Rithmere
and is a lover of games.</i>

00:24:17.900 --> 00:24:19.500
<i>He is of the Mere tribe.</i>

00:24:21.050 --> 00:24:25.500
While selecting representatives for each of the seven tribes,
and with the day of the ceremony approaching,

00:24:25.500 --> 00:24:27.700
Steven's brother appeared yet again.

00:24:29.400 --> 00:24:30.700
This is terrible!

00:24:30.940 --> 00:24:34.820
Nevets Goes Berserk!

00:24:32.000 --> 00:24:34.810
Next time, 'Nevets Goes Berserk!'.

00:24:49.840 --> 00:24:54.800
See you next time
